# Vercel production (Hobby)

Live URL: `https://quizz-by-ia.vercel.app`. GitHub is connected; push `master` to deploy.

## Commits

- Author must be the GitHub-linked owner: `Yowshi <294892313+ShivaneUN@users.noreply.github.com>`.
- Never commit as `developer@example.com` — Hobby blocks the deploy.
- Do not add `Co-authored-by: Cursor` (or other AI trailers). Hobby treats extra authors as collaborators.
- After `npm install`, `scripts/setup-git.mjs` sets local identity and `core.hooksPath`.

## Serverless functions

- Max **12** files matching `api/*.ts` (Hobby limit). `npm run build` fails above that.
- New HTTP route: fold it into an existing `api/*.ts` handler and add a `vercel.json` rewrite (see `/api/gen-status` → `/api/generate-questions`).

## After a Ready deploy

If `quizz-by-ia.vercel.app` still shows the old site, run `npm run alias:prod`.
Do not commit `.env.local` or `.vercel`.
